1
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:02,980
<i>I regret nothing.</i>

2
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:09,760
<i>Even if I never stop foot on this land again,</i>

3
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:13,120
<i>even if our name is tainted and covered in dirt,</i>

4
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:21,490
<i>the scenery I loved is burned into my vision.</i>

5
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:25,150
<i>Ladybird.</i>

6
00:00:37,290 --> 00:00:39,640
Lady Elianna and Lady Sophia?

7
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,650
Where could they be off to?

8
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:45,900
It's reassuring to have you come with me, Lady Elianna.

9
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:50,940
I was invited by Lady Lilia to explore the old castle,
but I was so nervous.

10
00:00:51,790 --> 00:00:56,160
<i>That Liliaâ€¦ she's so full of curiosity.</i>

11
00:01:02,730 --> 00:01:05,670
You are an eyesore, Lady Elianna.

12
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:07,670
Lady Sophia!

13
00:01:07,670 --> 00:01:10,760
I'll send someone to get you in a little while.

14
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:16,680
In the meantime, I have called for another noble to join us,
so you can get to know each other better.

15
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:29,320
You are far too careless.

